    "items": [
      "Changing `EncWolf` 023ABE also needs six records that use it as their template but not for `Stats`: `EncSummonFamiliar` 0640B5 (Familiar, level 2; on Conjured → *Summoned Atronachs*); `SummonFlamingThrall` 09CE28 (Flaming Thrall, level 1) and `ccFFBSSE001_WolfSpirit` 000829:ccffbsse001-imperialdragon.esl (Wolf Spirit, PC × 1) (both on Conjured → *Familiars & Spirit Animals*); `HowlSummonWolf` 0CF79E (werewolf howl summon, level 1; named on the *Companions* group page); `dunPOITrappedWolf` 0D1684 and `dunWhiteRiverWatchWolf` 0E1672 (placed dungeon wolves, level 2; under Placed only).",
      "Changing `EncWolfIce` 023ABF also needs `DLC1HowlSummonIceWolf` 008A6C:Dawnguard.esm (werewolf howl summon, level 6; named on the *Companions* group page) and `EncC06WolfSpirit` 058303 (Kodlak’s Wolf Spirit, PC × 1 [8–]; on Werebeasts → *Wolf Spirits*): they use 023ABF as their template but not for `Stats`.",
      "`dunHunterWolfGuardian`: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "`EncWolfDead` 0753CE (a wolf corpse, level 2, no template; three refs) is on no census page.",
      "Every other wolf record (`EncWolfRed`, `EncWolf_Indoor`, `EncWolfIce_Indoor`, `EncBanditWolf`, the `dunBloatedMans`, `dunShadowgreen`, `dunFellglow` wolves, `ccBGSSSE064_Wolf`, `SummonFireStorm`, `BYOHWolf`, the spriggan-companion wolves and every `Lvl*` wrapper) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list."
    ]
  },
